  "body": "What is missing: no MCP tool sets the thread infeed plan parameters. These include the infeed plan, the alternating flank and the \"repeat each depth\" (spring pass) setting. The GUI Passes tab sets them through an undoable command.\n\nEvidence: PR #518 adds these parameters (see `crates/app/src/project/thread_dto.rs` and the `turning_thread_infeed` test binary). It adds no tool in `crates/app/src/mcp/`. AGENTS.md says that each user-facing command ships with an MCP tool.\n\nFound in the review of PR #518.\n\nDone means: an MCP tool sets and reads the thread infeed plan through the same undoable command as the GUI. A test in `crates/app/tests/` pins the tool. The `camcraft-mcp` skill has a row for it.\n",
